tras/387f3f982a427947c240e1b153a08011.poster.avif?t=1664379083\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501730/extras/387f3f982a427947c240e1b153a08011.gif?t=1664379083\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><strong>Citizens </strong><br>Each citizen, or subject, is able to become a specialist in their field. Assign a citizen to mine rocks and they will become an expert miner. If you assign that miner to cook...well, your food may be consistently burnt. Your citizens are able to improve upon their specialized skills when they dedicate their time to a specific task - so choose wisely.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501730/extras/ffced095b458579c5a751a4dfe86c67d.poster.avif?t=1664379083\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501730/extras/ffced095b458579c5a751a4dfe86c67d.webm?t=1664379083\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1501730/extras/ffced095b458579c5a751a4dfe86c67d.mp4?t=1664379083\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Assignments </strong><br>Assemble a squadron of trusted citizens to go beyond the village to complete tasks. With every successful mission, your influence and fame will increase.",
